WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Ninety seconds of nothing on screen.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.400
The spec asks for twenty to forty.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.100
It is not the model's speed. It is how often we ask.

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.100
One page needs no model, so it goes first.

5
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.200
First content, 23 seconds. No model running.

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.900
And the second page for a question doubles the wait.

7
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.200
So one page a question, and the rest are named.

8
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.200
Counted with no model. 128 calls become 88.

9
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.500
Basecamp changes by nothing, and that is right.

10
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.800
The seconds are the model's. Discovery is next.

11
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.300
S1: a demo you can sit through.
